---
description: Workflow engine, read the design docs first
globs: packages/engine/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Before creating or changing `packages/engine`, read the engine designs
  listed in `docs/designs/INDEX.md` (tag `engine`): DES-003 lifecycle and
  engine, DES-004 conditions and loops, DES-005 agents and spawn,
  DES-006 sandboxing. Follow them.
- Append, then act. State is only a fold over the SQLite event log.
  Shared workflow and event schemas live in `packages/shared`.
- Pick work from `docs/backlogs/INDEX.md` and update the item's status.
- If the code needs to differ from a design, update that design doc and
  its `updated` date in the same change.
